---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Post.astro";

const title = "Terms of Use - WhatsApp Bot";
const description =
  "Terms of use for Antonio Gioia's personal WhatsApp bot using WhatsApp Business Platform / Cloud API.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>{title}</h1>

  <p>Last updated: June 12, 2026</p>

  <p>
    These Terms of Use apply to the personal WhatsApp bot/agent managed by
    Antonio Gioia.
  </p>

  <p>
    The bot uses WhatsApp Business Platform / Cloud API to receive messages,
    send replies, and support personal automated communication. By sending a
    message to the bot, you agree to use it only for lawful, respectful, and
    appropriate purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of the bot</h2>

  <p>
    You must not use the bot to send unlawful, abusive, misleading, harmful, or
    spam messages. Access to the bot may be limited, suspended, or blocked if
    misuse is detected.
  </p>

  <h2>Automated replies</h2>

  <p>
    The bot may generate automatic replies. These replies are provided for
    convenience and may not always be complete, accurate, or up to date. Manual
    review or intervention may occur when needed.
  </p>

  <h2>Availability</h2>

  <p>
    The bot is provided as a personal tool and may be changed, interrupted, or
    discontinued at any time without notice.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy and data deletion</h2>

  <p>
    Information about data processing is available in the
    <a href="/whatsapp-bot/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. You can request deletion
    of your WhatsApp conversation data by following the
    <a href="/whatsapp-bot/data-deletion">Data Deletion Instructions</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>

  <p>
    For questions about these Terms of Use, contact
    <a href="mailto:antonio.gioia.dev@gmail.com"
      >antonio.gioia.dev@gmail.com</a
    >.
  </p>
</Layout>
